# Push to main

- After committing, **always push to `main`**.
- If this agent created a pull request, **merge it into `main`** in the same turn. Do not leave the PR open.
- Prefer `git checkout main && git merge <branch> && git push origin main` when `gh` write/merge is unavailable.
- Do not include unrelated working-tree files in the merge.
